         reading : per-cluster amplitude, bootstrap error and shuffle-null all measured on the committed v_los, X, Y.
  [PASS] C7 [part 3] the stacked amplitude excess is consistent with the null (no detected rotation)
         measured: excess +30.5 +- 23.6 km/s per R500, z = +1.29; coherent z = +0.66 (vs null); Rayleigh z = +0.79
         reading : the committed kinematics show NO significant projected v_los gradient at the core: amplitude mode z = 1.2, aligned mode z = 0.6, axis distribution uniform (z = 0.8) -- the core does not present a coherent spin in the stack.
  [PASS] C8 [part 3] the beta-implied rotation is excluded by the direct gradient measurement
